# Hello Counter

This is a simple blog post written in **mdsvex**.

Because mdsvex compiles to a Svelte component, we can embed
interactive widgets directly inside the content.

Here is a live counter:

<Counter />

Pretty neat, right?

The page is prerendered, so this text appears instantly,
and the counter hydrates afterward.